{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 的 S01、S05 等短时段里，未标记为到时出现的感受词仍然偏密，扫读效率不如 X 的左右分栏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用放大加亮的关键词让人迅速抓住每段叙述的核心动机，而且感受与音乐段落对应，能让观众边听边感知情绪如何变化。从最初害怕被嫌弃，到逐渐相信彼此可能互相需要，再到愿意接受无法保证永远，Y 的心理推进和水波、船、靠岸等意象回扣更完整，感受也更有具体的声音、身体和时间细节。X 的优势是叙事扫读更直接，但情绪层次与音乐之间的对应不如 Y 丰富。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e18b93a-0b29-46c4-b94a-f79745c76f59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T230951348273Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.141, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:11:19.497661+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "26edeb38c67ef9428a23800c6b9f53f6519c56f851a6d22832182cfff851f00c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm